{"id":748,"slug":"the-tales-of-hoffmann","title":"The Tales of Hoffmann","year":1951,"country":"United Kingdom","duration":133,"spine":317,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/748-the-tales-of-hoffmann","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/f5f93fa11c4a433beac47edae7573b3a/0vs8sbST33D8PCQoXuU2xPZjtDFT1g_large.jpg","description":"Michael Powell and Emeric Pressburger create a phantasmagoric marriage of cinema and opera in this one-of-a-kind take on a classic story. In Jacques Offenbach’s fantasy opera The Tales of Hoffmann, a poet dreams of three women—a mechanical performing doll, a bejeweled siren, and the consumptive daughter of a famous composer—all of whom break his heart in different ways. Powell and Pressburger’s feverishly romantic adaptation is a feast of music, dance, and visual effects, and one of the most exhilarating opera films ever produced. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Michael Powell","slug":"michael-powell"},{"name":"Emeric Pressburger","slug":"emeric-pressburger"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Robert Rounseville","role":"Hoffmann","slug":"robert-rounseville"},{"actor":"Moira Shearer","role":"Stella/His Ladylove/Olympia","slug":"moira-shearer"},{"actor":"Pamela Brown","role":"Nicklaus","slug":"pamela-brown"},{"actor":"Edmond Audran","role":"Cancer","slug":"edmond-audran"},{"actor":"Robert Helpmann","role":"Councillor Lindorf/Coppelius/Dapertutto/Dr. Miracle","slug":"robert-helpmann"},{"actor":"Meinhart Maur","role":"Luther","slug":"meinhart-maur"},{"actor":"Frederick Ashton","role":"Kleinzach/Cochenille","slug":"frederick-ashton"},{"actor":"Philip Leaver","role":"Andreas","slug":"philip-leaver"},{"actor":"John Ford","role":"Nathaniel","slug":"john-ford"},{"actor":"Léonide Massine","role":"Spalanzani/Schlemil/Franz","slug":"leonide-massine"},{"actor":"Alan Carter","role":"Bank clerk","slug":"alan-carter"},{"actor":"Ludmilla Tchérina","role":"Giulietta","slug":"ludmilla-tcherina"},{"actor":"Lionel Harris","role":"Pitichi